%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Q11-LangGraph%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q11</a></td>\n<td>LangGraph 构建多智能体工作流</td>\n<td>medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Q12-多智能体系统生产部署考量\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/07-%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Q12-%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E8%80%83%E9%87%8F/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/07-%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Q12-%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E8%80%83%E9%87%8F/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q12</a></td>\n<td>多智能体系统的生产部署考量</td>\n<td>high</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"A2A 协议详解\" dir=\"auto\">A2A 协议详解</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A2A（Agent-to-Agent Protocol）是 Google 推出的开放协议，用于标准化不同 Agent 之间的通信。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"核心能力\" dir=\"auto\">核心能力</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Capability Discovery</strong> — Agent 能力发现</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Task Management</strong> — 任务生命周期管理</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Collaborative Execution</strong> — 协作执行</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Secure Communication</strong> — 安全通信</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"A2A vs MCP\" dir=\"auto\">A2A vs MCP</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>A2A</th>\n<th>MCP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>定位</td>\n<td>Agent 间通信</td>\n<td>模型与工具/数据连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发起方</td>\n<td>Agent</td>\n<td>Model/Client</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议层</td>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>传输层+应用层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系</td>\n<td>互补</td>\n<td>互补</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">详见：<a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/07-%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Q04-A2A%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/07-%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Q04-A2A%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q04-A2A协议详解</a>、<a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/07-%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Q05-A2A%E4%B8%8EMCP%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/07-%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Q05-A2A%E4%B8%8EMCP%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q05-A2A与MCP协议区别关系</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"多 Agent 协作模式\" dir=\"auto\">多 Agent 协作模式</h2>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">协作模式\n├── 层级式 (Hierarchical)\n│   ├── Manager → Worker 结构\n│   └── 适合：任务明确的团队管理\n├── 平等式 (Peer-to-Peer)\n│   ├── 多 Agent 平等协商\n│   └── 适合：开放式讨论、头脑风暴\n├── 竞争式 (Competitive)\n│   ├── 多 Agent 竞争最优解\n│   └── 适合：方案评估、择优场景\n└── 市场式 (Market-Based)\n    ├── 拍卖/竞价机制分配任务\n    └── 适合：资源优化、负载均衡\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"多 Agent 系统架构\" dir=\"auto\">多 Agent 系统架构</h2>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           协调层 (Orchestrator)       │\n│    任务分解 / 分配 / 调度 / 聚合      │\n├──────────┬──────────┬───────────────┤\n│  Agent 1  │  Agent 2  │    Agent N    │\n│  (角色A)  │  (角色B)  │    (角色C)    │\n├──────────┴──────────┴───────────────┤\n│         通信层 (A2A / Message Queue)   │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│         共享状态 / 记忆存储            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关 MOC\" dir=\"auto\">相关 MOC</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 单 Agent 基础</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> — CrewAI、AutoGen、LangGraph 实现</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a> — MCP 协议与 A2A 的关系</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> — 多 Agent 系统的生产部署</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}